Hi, everyone:

I would like to draw your attention to a study done jointly by MIT and the
University of Munich on the development of embedded Linux.

Since it is a non-commercial study, I hope this is not too much of an intrusion.

Unlike most commercial studies, we are interested not so much in the use, but
in the development of embedded Linux.

Please take 10 min to participate (and maybe win one of 5 original Oktoberfest
beer steins!).

Here's the survey:
http://www.inno-tec.bwl.uni-muenchen.de/survey/survey_embedded_linux.htm

Many thanks
Joachim Henkel


